WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.300
DocIQ, iMBrace's document reader, selects a model for each synthetic document.

2
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:24.240
Processing Logs show each document, its type and saved destination.

3
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:35.300
A clean invoice reaches the demo destination; exceptions wait with visible reasons.

4
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:53.200
An automated test corrects the purchase order and accepts the remaining values.

5
00:00:53.200 --> 00:01:04.700
An automated test records finance decisions through the visible form.

6
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:12.220
The corrected invoice passes fresh checks before reaching the demo finance board.
